+3.  **Transformer Processing:** Pass the concatenated sequence through a transformer block (or stack of blocks) that attends to relationships between image features and camera poses [S1, unofficial].
+4.  **Decoding:** Decode the output tokens from the transformer into the full set of 3D Gaussian parameters ($\mu, \Sigma, c, \alpha$) [S1, unofficial].
 
